 Its `--check` mode and unit checks validate the full/reduced projection and reject
 statements that cannot be skipped under this guard.
 
+The full and reduced operand tables supply flags and access masks from the
+same row. BOUND and UD1 expose two read operands and leave flags unchanged.
+CMPXCHG reads its source and both reads and writes its destination.
+CMPXCHG8B and CMPXCHG16B expose a read/write memory operand. The mapping
+unit checks every corresponding opcode after table updates.
